ps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3238305394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110085#issuecomment-3238305394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085","id":3238305394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BBJ5y","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-29T21:21:31Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T21:21:31Z","body":"> I can confirm this on 4.5.beta [825ef23](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/825ef2387f87de1c350696886e6c50b039204cef) (Linux + NVIDIA).\n> \n> I've tested the MRP with [#107234](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107234) and noticed that the PR _reverses_ the issue: it no longer occurs near the origin, but it starts occurring far from the origin (where it looked correct previously).\n\nReversing the issue is the correct behaviour. Since only 8 lights can be used, we typically want those to be the 8 closest lights. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3238305394/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3238327121","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110085#issuecomment-3238327121","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085","id":3238327121,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BBPNR","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-29T21:29:33Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T21:31:34Z","body":"> Reversing the issue is the correct behaviour. Since only 8 lights can be used, we typically want those to be the 8 closest lights.\n\nAren't most of the lights behind the camera frustum when we're far from the origin (on the `light_count_limit_pr` video I posted on the PR)? In this case, they could probably be culled as you wouldn't see them.\n\nSpecifically, in this situation, I would expect at least one of the lights to be culled for being too far behind the camera, which would allow the light in front of the camera to render:\n\n<img width=\"812\" height=\"445\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4325bc6e-1b26-42c4-879c-c686e0ded0db\" />\n<br><br>\n\nThe lights in the MRP have a range of `5.0`, so they're small enough to be culled in this situation.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3238327121/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3246690243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110085#issuecomment-3246690243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085","id":3246690243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BhI_D","user":{"login":"jon1solution","id":143551917,"node_id":"U_kgDOCI5trQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143551917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution","html_url":"https://github.com/jon1solution","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jon1solution/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T20:27:02Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T20:27:02Z","body":"It looks as if the lights are not culled by the camera frustum at the point where they are linked to the mesh instance.  So 